# ── Call Team IVR — environment example ────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env (or set as GitHub Actions secrets) and fill in your values.
# NEVER commit real values. Only placeholders/examples live in the repo.

# The Google Sheet that is the single source of truth.
# Each tab in this sheet becomes a brand/hotline page.
GOOGLE_SHEETS_ID=1HZtIq4jt4EHrw2Ord3yqXkdLOHN7h-EDJYK7SbyeQKY

# ── OPTIONAL: only needed if the sheet is NOT link-shared "anyone with link" ──
# If you restrict the sheet, provide a service account so the build can read it.
# The build currently uses the public xlsx export (no auth) — set these only if
# you make the sheet private.
# GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON={"type":"service_account", ...}
